{"id":"2cbe3d8d855b52d0","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-term-functor.md","title":"项的判断相等类预层","display":"df-term-functor — 项的判断相等类预层","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-term-functor","aliases":["16-df-term-functor","Term presheaf"],"display":"df-term-functor — 项的判断相等类预层","depends_on":["[[16-df-set]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-type-functor]]","[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]"],"source":"§10.2–§10.4; p. 612 (PDF 632); quotient term-presheaf presentation","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-term-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-term-functor</span><span>Term presheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term-functor — 项的判断相等类预层"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"58c65ff26967e699\" href=\"?note=58c65ff26967e699\" title=\"16-df-type-functor\">16-df-type-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b40125e21710f48\" href=\"?note=3b40125e21710f48\" title=\"16-df-syntactic-substitution\">16-df-syntactic-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.2–§10.4; p. 612 (PDF 632); quotient term-presheaf presentation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma:\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma:\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58c65ff26967e699\" href=\"?note=58c65ff26967e699\" title=\"16-df-type-functor\">16-df-type-functor</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是该页使用的有限强 DTT 展示，所有语法树与商集在同一足够大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 中。语法判断与同时替换采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3b40125e21710f48\" href=\"?note=3b40125e21710f48\" title=\"16-df-syntactic-substitution\">16-df-syntactic-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r^T_\\sigma\">\\(r^T_\\sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"58c65ff26967e699\" href=\"?note=58c65ff26967e699\" title=\"16-df-type-functor\">16-df-type-functor</a> 明确构造的类型代入函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 表示其对象分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\sim^\\Gamma_T B\">\\(A\\sim^\\Gamma_T B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\sim^{\\Gamma,A}_t u\">\\(t\\sim^{\\Gamma,A}_t u\\)</span> 是下文定义的关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]\">\\([A]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t]\">\\([t]\\)</span> 分别取这两个商。上下文对象不再对类型转换另取商，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 保持一致。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal G_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是下文按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 六元组编码构造的类型预层元素范畴。其箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle\">\\(\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 已带源靶标签的箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_\\sigma\">\\(r_\\sigma\\)</span> 是下文定义的项类代入函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 的箭头为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 的三元组，反范畴和函子谓词采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA\\sim^\\Gamma_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\nt\\sim^{\\Gamma,A}_t u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t=u:A,\\\\\nO_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,a)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nM_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(\\Delta,b),(\\Gamma,a),\\sigma\\rangle\\mid\n(\\Delta,b),(\\Gamma,a)\\in O_G\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Delta,\\Gamma)\n\\land b=r^T_\\sigma(a)\\},\\\\\ns_G\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq U,\\qquad t_G\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle\\coloneqq V,\\\\\ne_G(\\Gamma,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\Gamma,a),(\\Gamma,a),\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\rangle,\\\\\nc_G(\\langle V,W,\\tau\\rangle,\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle U,W,\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal G_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_G,M_G,s_G,t_G,e_G,c_G\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\textstyle\\int\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal G_\\Sigma,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal G_\\Sigma)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA\\sim^\\Gamma_T B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma A=B:\\mathsf{Ty},\\\\\nt\\sim^{\\Gamma,A}_t u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t=u:A,\\\\\nO_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\Gamma,a)\\mid\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma\\land a\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\nM_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(\\Delta,b),(\\Gamma,a),\\sigma\\rangle\\mid\n(\\Delta,b),(\\Gamma,a)\\in O_G\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Delta,\\Gamma)\n\\land b=r^T_\\sigma(a)\\},\\\\\ns_G\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq U,\\qquad t_G\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle\\coloneqq V,\\\\\ne_G(\\Gamma,a)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\Gamma,a),(\\Gamma,a),\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma\\rangle,\\\\\nc_G(\\langle V,W,\\tau\\rangle,\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle U,W,\\tau\\circ\\sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal G_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_G,M_G,s_G,t_G,e_G,c_G\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\textstyle\\int\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\\mathcal G_\\Sigma,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal G_\\Sigma)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma,[A])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in\\mathsf{RawTm}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\}/{\\sim^{\\Gamma,A}_t},\\\\\nr_\\sigma([t])&amp;\\coloneqq[t[\\vec a]]\n\\quad\\bigl(\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_1\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\langle(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0V,(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0U,r_\\sigma\\bigr\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0,(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma,\\mathcal G_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0(\\Gamma,[A])&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in\\mathsf{RawTm}\\mid\\Gamma\\vdash_\\Sigma t:A\\}/{\\sim^{\\Gamma,A}_t},\\\\\nr_\\sigma([t])&amp;\\coloneqq[t[\\vec a]]\n\\quad\\bigl(\\sigma=\\langle\\Delta,\\Gamma,[\\vec a]\\rangle\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_1\\langle U,V,\\sigma\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigl\\langle(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0V,(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0U,r_\\sigma\\bigr\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_0,(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(\\operatorname{Tm}_\\Sigma,\\mathcal G_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>类型转换使判断相等类型有相同的良型项集和相同的项相等关系，因此对象公式不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的代表。替换同余保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_\\sigma\">\\(r_\\sigma\\)</span> 不依赖项或替换的代表。替换的单位律和复合律给出元素范畴及反变项函子的单位律和复合律。</p>\n<p>源靶标签、恒等和复合均已明确写出；理解元素范畴不再依靠自然语言中的惯例。这里仍是在原始良构语境范畴上的项预层，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7d6e82f8b4b6d41d\" href=\"?note=7d6e82f8b4b6d41d\" title=\"16-df-term-model\">16-df-term-model</a> 的同时取商语境呈现不同。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.2–§10.4 的语法替换与项模型构造；本页补写预层元素范畴的完整集合记录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-type-functor","status":"resolved","id":"58c65ff26967e699","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-type-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-syntactic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"3b40125e21710f48","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-type-functor","status":"resolved","id":"58c65ff26967e699","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma:\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-type-functor]]；$\\Sigma$ 是该页使用的有限强 DTT 展示，所有语法树与商集在同一足够大的 $\\mathcal U$ 中。语法判断与同时替换采用 [[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-syntactic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"3b40125e21710f48","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma:\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-type-functor]]；$\\Sigma$ 是该页使用的有限强 DTT 展示，所有语法树与商集在同一足够大的 $\\mathcal U$ 中。语法判断与同时替换采用 [[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-type-functor","status":"resolved","id":"58c65ff26967e699","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r^T_\\sigma$ 是 [[16-df-type-functor]] 明确构造的类型代入函数；$\\operatorname{Ty}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$ 表示其对象分量。$A\\sim^\\Gamma_T B$、$t\\sim^{\\Gamma,A}_t u$ 是下文定义的关系；$[A]$、$[t]$ 分别取这两个商。上下文对象不再对类型转换另取商，与 $\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma$ 保持一致。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":